      "type": "explain",
      "md": "## Two module systems\n\n`require` / `module.exports` is CommonJS. `import` / `export` is ESM. Node picks ESM for `.mjs` or `\"type\": \"module\"`.\n\nThis lesson is ESM: export `ping` and print `pong`."
    },
